WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.210
Detective Smith looked at the Mrs. Wiggles robot.

2
00:00:16.211 --> 00:00:19.135
"So the real Mrs. Wiggles escaped!

3
00:00:19.136 --> 00:00:21.706
But how did she make that hole?

4
00:00:21.707 --> 00:00:25.655
It's so smooth, as if it was made with—"

5
00:00:25.656 --> 00:00:29.130
Roxy gasped. "Magic!"

6
00:00:29.131 --> 00:00:34.672
Detective Smith raised an eyebrow. "Huh?"

7
00:00:34.673 --> 00:00:38.176
Using her x-ray vision, Roxy looked at Mr. Presto.

8
00:00:38.177 --> 00:00:41.266
The magician was also a robot!

9
00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.435
And who made the robots?

10
00:00:43.436 --> 00:00:45.560
Roxy spun toward another prisoner.

11
00:00:45.561 --> 00:00:48.673
"Dr. Odd!"

12
00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:53.318
With her x-ray vision, she saw that Dr. Odd was a robot too.

13
00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.851
Roxy bit her lip.

14
00:00:55.852 --> 00:00:59.869
"This is terrible. Everyone from school is gone.

15
00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.288
And now at least three villains have escaped!"

16
00:01:03.289 --> 00:01:05.527
Detective Smith pulled out his phone.

17
00:01:05.528 --> 00:01:08.108
"I'll find the address of Dr. Odd's headquarters.

18
00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:10.270
Maybe they went there."

19
00:01:10.271 --> 00:01:15.187
"Or to Mrs. Wiggles' empty candy factory," Roxy said.

20
00:01:15.188 --> 00:01:21.455
Just then her watch beeped. "Mayor Bloom?"

21
00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:25.771
"Nope. This is Kid Rocket!"

22
00:01:25.772 --> 00:01:29.985
Roxy rolled her eyes. "Hi, Terrell."

23
00:01:29.986 --> 00:01:32.145
Terrell sounded excited.

24
00:01:32.146 --> 00:01:34.668
"I think I found everyone from school!

25
00:01:34.669 --> 00:01:38.694
I followed a trail of pencils, papers, and books.

26
00:01:38.695 --> 00:01:41.537
It led me to the candy factory."

27
00:01:41.538 --> 00:01:43.762
"Whoa!" Roxy said.

28
00:01:43.763 --> 00:01:48.266
"Then Mrs. Wiggles is definitely involved in the stuff at school too.

29
00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:50.738
I'll be right there, Terrell!"

30
00:01:50.739 --> 00:01:53.013
Detective Smith put away his phone.

31
00:01:53.014 --> 00:01:58.791
"Okay, Rocket Girl, I think—Rocket Girl?"

32
00:01:58.792 --> 00:02:01.274
Roxy flew to the candy factory.

33
00:02:01.275 --> 00:02:06.761
Terrell was waiting outside. "Hey, Roxy!"

34
00:02:06.762 --> 00:02:08.933
"Shh!" Roxy said.

35
00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:12.554
"Don't use my real name when I'm Rocket Girl."

36
00:02:12.555 --> 00:02:16.670
"Oh, right," Terrell said. "Sorry."

37
00:02:16.671 --> 00:02:19.408
Roxy spotted an open window upstairs.

38
00:02:19.409 --> 00:02:21.787
She shot inside.

39
00:02:21.788 --> 00:02:25.458
Below, kids and teachers were gathered on the factory floor.

40
00:02:25.459 --> 00:02:28.068
Mrs. Wiggles stood on a platform.

41
00:02:28.069 --> 00:02:30.747
She held a long licorice rope.

42
00:02:30.748 --> 00:02:33.973
Roxy didn't see Mr. Presto or Dr. Odd.

43
00:02:33.974 --> 00:02:38.368
"Tell me now! Who is Rocket Girl?"

44
00:02:38.369 --> 00:02:40.833
Mrs. Wiggles said to the crowd.

45
00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:42.790
Nobody answered.

46
00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:45.142
Mrs. Wiggles stamped her foot.

47
00:02:45.143 --> 00:02:48.688
"I know one of you is Rocket Girl!

48
00:02:48.689 --> 00:02:49.857
She's a kid.

49
00:02:49.858 --> 00:02:53.009
That means she goes to school.

50
00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:57.498
Now tell me where she is!"

51
00:02:57.499 --> 00:03:01.124
"We won't tell you anything!" Principal Penn shouted.

52
00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:03.763
"Yeah!" Jack cried.

53
00:03:03.764 --> 00:03:06.475
Roxy flew over the crowd.

54
00:03:06.476 --> 00:03:09.254
"I'm right here, Mrs. Wiggles!"

55
00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:12.514
"Rocket Girl!" Mara cried.

56
00:03:12.515 --> 00:03:15.439
Mrs. Wiggles gave Roxy an evil look.

57
00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.605
Roxy shot toward the villain.

58
00:03:18.606 --> 00:03:21.625
Just then Mr. Presto stepped out of a corner.

59
00:03:21.626 --> 00:03:27.295
"One, two, three, presto!"

60
00:03:27.296 --> 00:03:30.328
Roxy was suddenly in another room in the factory.

61
00:03:30.329 --> 00:03:33.455
A door opened, and Mrs. Wiggles stepped in.

62
00:03:33.456 --> 00:03:35.891
She had an evil smile.

63
00:03:35.892 --> 00:03:39.087
A big robot smashed through a wall.

64
00:03:39.088 --> 00:03:42.008
Roxy saw Dr. Odd inside the robot.

65
00:03:42.009 --> 00:03:45.061
Poof! Mr. Presto appeared.

66
00:03:45.062 --> 00:03:51.528
Roxy gulped. "I'm surrounded by villains!"
